From 2254f71aea2bc06bfbcf48f5232e2dd2bde3986c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hoinzy <1684934+hoinzy@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 03:37:06 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] webui-vue: add flexible TRX40 fan-control editor

Expose selectable temperature sources and editable hysteresis alongside a variable two-to-twenty-point curve. Render and preview the response with piecewise-linear interpolation, allow pointer and keyboard dragging, retain precise numeric editing, and cover source persistence and curve math with unit tests.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [TRX40D8-2N2T-specific fan UI and OEM API]
